<title>GERMANY: Train with nuclear containers derails in France.</title>
<headline>Train with nuclear containers derails in France.</headline>
<dateline>SAARBRUECKEN, Germany 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A train carrying containers designed to hold nuclear waste came off the rails in France close to the German border early on Tuesday, the interior ministry of Germany's Saar state said.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be established whether the containers were carrying any nuclear material or in which direction the train was travelling.</p>
</text>
